plugin_views` becomes `{name, kind, title, ...}` and a config routes by *kind*, never by name.\n\nThat's a schema + SDK + state change — bigger than a config tweak, and it's the right way to get what you're asking for.\n\nBefore I build it, one decision I shouldn't make for you:",
