it's the better layout, and \"what I run is the default\" is what you said you want), and **build the placement primitive** — without it, any non-sidebar plugin panel forces a name back into the config, so we'd just be repeating this.\n\nOne flag either way: your config isn't in git, so if we promote it I'd copy it into the repo rather than move it, leaving your working setup intact until you're happy.",
