ndering logic in render.rs\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Proposed (Plugin + Lua)\\n\\n```\\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│                         TUI Application (app.rs)                            │\\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\\n│                                                                             │\\n│  Action::OpenDiff                                                           │\\n│  │                                                                          │\\n│  └─► open_git_diff()                                                        │\\n│      ├─ Run: git diff HEAD                                                  │\\n│      └─► Call plugin:                                                       │\\n│          kn9t_plugin_diff::parse_git_diff(text)                             │\\n│          │                                                                  │\\n│          ▼                                                                  │\\n│      ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐                      │\\n│      │  kn9t-plugin-diff (Rust)                     │                      │\\n│      ├──────────────────────────────────────────────┤                      │\\n│      │  DiffPanel (NEW)                             │                      │\\n│      │  ├─ State: files, cursor, scroll, comments   │                      │\\n│      │  ├─ Setters: set_current_file(), set_scroll()│                      │\\n│      │  ├─ Getters: get_files(), get_file_status()  │                      │\\n│      │  ├─ Comments: add_comment(), get_comments()  │                      │\\n│      │  └─ Export: Arc<Mutex<DiffPanel>>            │                      │\\n│      │                                              │                      │\\n│      │  parse_git_diff(text) → DiffPanel            │                      │\\n│      │  ├─ Parse unified diff format                │                      │\\n│      │  ├─ Detect file status (M/A/D)              │                      │\\n│      │  └─ Build hunk structures                    │                      │\\n│      └──────────────────────────────────────────────┘                      │\\n│           │                                                                │\\n│           └─► app.diff_panel = Arc<Mutex<DiffPanel>>                      │\\n│                                                                             │\\n│   handle_key() ─────────────┬──────────────────────────────┐              │\\n│                             │ Check diff_panel.is_some()   │              │\\n│                             └──────────────────────────────┘              │\\n│                                      ▼                                    │\\n│                        ┌────────────────────────────┐                    │\\n│                        │ Lua dispatch_keymap()      │                    │\\n│                        │ ◄───────────────────────── │ Always checked     │\\n│                        │ (returns true if handled)  │ for diff keys      │\\n│                        └────────────────────────────┘                    │\\n│                                      │                                   │\\n│                   ┌──────────────────┴──────────────────┐               │\\n│                   │ Lua action handler in diff.lua:     │               │\\n│                   │                                    │               │\\n│                   │ diff:next_file =>                  │               │\\n│                   │   panel:set_current_file(idx+1)    │               │\\n│                   │                                    │               │\\n│                   │ diff:cursor_down =>                │               │\\n│                   │   panel:set_cursor_line(idx+1)     │               │\\n│                   │                                    │          